      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a harsh reality that integrity can be a double-edged sword, offering little tangible reward. But it's equally important not to give up on your own worth, even in the face of adversity. Every individual's truth is valid, and right is not measured by external validation, but by the sincerity of one's own conviction. You may be worn down, but you are not erased.",
      "source": "target",
