      "content": "but \"not being erased\" doesn't change the fact that my life is effectively over. i have no career, no support, and nothing to look forward to but more of this isolation. it feels like the \"moral high ground\" is just a lonely, empty place to die. why should i keep fighting for a life that's already been taken away from me? it feels like the only thing i actually have control over is when this all ends.",
